From aff9f4216aea282370c04d693c2c762c8ba69736 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxis J <maxis1901@mail.ru>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 00:41:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] mediatek: filogic: add support for Huastlink HC-G80

Add initial support for the Huastlink HC-G80 based on MediaTek MT7981 (Filogic 820).

This change adds board DTS/DTSI files and image definitions in
target/linux/mediatek/image/filogic.mk, and includes the required
uboot-mediatek integration for this target.

Two flash layouts are supported:
- vendor/OEM bootloader layout
- OpenWrt bootloader layout

Tested on real hardware: boot, flashing, and basic LAN connectivity.

Signed-off-by: Maxis J <maxis1901@mail.ru>
